# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# contributor's OS or core.autocrlf setting. Prevents the repo-wide
# CRLF <-> LF formatting churn that previously made `bun run format` fail.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.zst binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
